# probe_lambert.py imports orbital.py from beside itself, so Python caches
# its bytecode here even though the probes run from an economicspace checkout.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# `probe_nhats.py --out` writes the joined frame wherever it is pointed.
# The only data this repo commits is sdsstax_ast.tab; see CITATIONS.md.
*.csv

# ...except the committed test fixtures.
!tests/fixtures/*.csv
